    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d467-a1">

                <pb facs="d467-3" n="3" xml:id="d467-3"/>


                <dateline><date calendar="gregorian" when="1963-08-13">August 13,
                    1963</date></dateline>
                <p>WMR</p>
                <p>The decision on full use of TEA authority is to be found in the memo of April 24
                    ’63 to the Governor from Feldman on
                    behalf of the President. I attach the memo and the referenced document (see
                    especially middle of page 2 of the letter).</p>
                <p>(Copies should be returned to Mr. Sleiner or to Cady for files.)</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>BN</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
